---
const title = "Disclaimer | DollarDost";
const description = "Important information about DollarDost calculator estimates, financial information and limitations.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://dollardost.pages.dev/disclaimer/" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0f172a" />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: #172033;
        background: #f8fafc;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      a { color: #15803d; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
      .container { width: min(900px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: auto; }
      .header-inner {
        min-height: 68px; display: flex; align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;
      }
      .logo { color: #0f172a; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: -1px; }
      .logo span { color: #16a34a; }
      nav { display: flex; gap: 18px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 650; }
      nav a { color: #172033; }
      main { padding: 42px 0 64px; }
      article {
        background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 18px;
        padding: clamp(22px, 5vw, 42px); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, .045);
      }
      h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 42px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -1px; }
      h2 { margin: 30px 0 8px; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
      p, li { color: #475569; }
      .updated { margin: 0 0 28px; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      footer { padding: 22px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
      .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 0; gap: 6px; }
        nav { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Dollar<span>Dost</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/creator-stack-calculator/">Creator Stack</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <article>
        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 27 November 2026</p>

        <p>
          DollarDost provides online calculators, tools and educational
          information for creators, freelancers and people receiving
          international income. By using this website, you acknowledge the
          limitations described below.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Informational purposes only</h2>
        <p>
          All content, calculations and results on DollarDost are provided
          for general informational and educational purposes only. They are
          not financial, tax, legal, accounting, investment or other
          professional advice. Using this website does not create an
          advisor-client, accountant-client or other professional relationship.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Estimates are not guaranteed results</h2>
        <p>
          Calculator results are estimates based on the information and
          assumptions available to the tool and the values you enter.
          Results may be incomplete, inaccurate or different from your actual
          financial outcome. We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness
          or currentness of any calculation, content, rate, fee or reference.
        </p>
        <p>
          Actual payments and payouts may differ because of provider fees,
          exchange-rate spreads, intermediary charges, bank fees, deductions,
          withholding, taxes, payment timing, refunds, disputes or changes
          made by a platform or financial institution.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Exchange rates and currency calculations</h2>
        <p>
          Currency calculations may use rates entered by the user or
          illustrative rates. The DollarDost Currency Calculator currently
          does not provide live exchange rates. A calculated conversion is
          not a quote, an executable transaction rate or a promise of the
          amount a bank or payment provider will deliver.
        </p>
        <p>
          Always confirm the applicable exchange rate, conversion spread
          and charges with your bank or payment provider before making a
          transaction.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Creator Stack and payment estimates</h2>
        <p>
          The Creator Stack Calculator models income, platform deductions,
          payment-route costs, currency conversion and estimated take-home
          amounts using the selected calculation stages and supplied inputs.
          Its output is a planning estimate, not a statement from a platform,
          payment provider or bank and not a guarantee of the amount you will
          receive.
        </p>
        <p>
          Provider fees and presets may depend on the information available
          to the calculator. Where a fee has not been verified, you should
          enter and confirm the applicable fee yourself rather than assume
          that an estimate is an official provider charge.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Tax estimates and compliance information</h2>
        <p>
          Any tax reserve, tax-related figure or compliance information
          shown by DollarDost is for general planning and educational
          purposes. A tax reserve selected or entered by you is not a
          calculation of your final tax liability, tax assessment or amount
          payable to a government authority.
        </p>
        <p>
          Tax treatment can depend on your residence, business structure,
          income type, place of work, source of income, applicable tax
          treaties, deductions, registrations and other individual facts.
          Rules and official interpretations may change. References to GST,
          LUT, FEMA, RBI requirements, foreign withholding or other
          compliance topics are not official legal or regulatory
          interpretations.
        </p>
        <p>
          Verify your position with relevant official sources and a
          qualified chartered accountant, tax adviser or legal professional
          before filing returns, making payments or taking compliance
          decisions.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Third-party platforms and services</h2>
        <p>
          References to platforms, banks, payment providers, marketplaces,
          government services and other third parties are provided for
          informational purposes. DollarDost does not control their
          products, services, fees, policies, availability or decisions.
          Their terms and charges may change without notice. A reference
          does not necessarily mean that DollarDost is affiliated with or
          endorsed by that organisation.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for checking the information you enter,
          confirming current rates and fees, reviewing official rules and
          independently evaluating any decision made using the website.
          Do not rely on a calculator result as the sole basis for a
          financial, tax, legal or business decision.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          To the extent permitted by applicable law, DollarDost is not
          responsible for losses or damages arising from reliance on
          estimates, information, third-party services or website
          availability. Nothing in this disclaimer excludes any
          responsibility that cannot lawfully be excluded.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Updates to this disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We may revise this disclaimer when our tools, content or website
          functionality changes. The date at the top indicates when this
          page was most recently updated.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about this disclaimer, contact
          <a href="mailto:dollardost92@gmail.com">dollardost92@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="container footer-inner">
        <span>© 2026 DollarDost. Made for the world's global earners.</span>
        <span><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
